{"mode":"words","text":"Arriba ves un texto tal y como te lo muestra la aplicación. Cada palabra es una pequeña ficha: arriba, la palabra en tu idioma de destino; debajo, su significado en tu lengua materna —palabra por palabra, en el orden del idioma de destino—. Debajo aparece de nuevo la frase completa traducida de forma fluida. En el caso de los idiomas con un alfabeto diferente, se añade una línea con la transcripción para que puedas leerlo todo. Toca una palabra: la voz continuará reproduciéndose exactamente a partir de ahí.","words":[{"s":0,"e":488},{"s":534,"e":685},{"s":766,"e":824},{"s":882,"e":1184},{"s":1300,"e":1521},{"s":1602,"e":1625},{"s":1683,"e":1892},{"s":1939,"e":2020},{"s":2055,"e":2125},{"s":2183,"e":2496},{"s":2543,"e":2612},{"s":2647,"e":3762},{"s":4458,"e":4702},{"s":4748,"e":5166},{"s":5201,"e":5259},{"s":5341,"e":5480},{"s":5526,"e":5921},{"s":5968,"e":6711},{"s":7221,"e":8022},{"s":8348,"e":8475},{"s":8522,"e":9067},{"s":9149,"e":9253},{"s":9323,"e":9416},{"s":9462,"e":9903},{"s":9950,"e":10031},{"s":10089,"e":10855},{"s":11238,"e":12086},{"s":12295,"e":12422},{"s":12469,"e":13166},{"s":13212,"e":13258},{"s":13316,"e":13409},{"s":13491,"e":13734},{"s":13781,"e":14303},{"s":14385,"e":15290},{"s":15360,"e":15522},{"s":15580,"e":16428},{"s":16869,"e":17020},{"s":17090,"e":17194},{"s":17275,"e":17566},{"s":17624,"e":17740},{"s":17798,"e":18135},{"s":18181,"e":18274},{"s":18332,"e":19098},{"s":20213,"e":20654},{"s":20677,"e":21176},{"s":21223,"e":21316},{"s":21362,"e":21687},{"s":21757,"e":21861},{"s":21931,"e":22268},{"s":22326,"e":22825},{"s":22883,"e":23510},{"s":23556,"e":23638},{"s":23684,"e":23963},{"s":24021,"e":24717},{"s":25669,"e":25867},{"s":25925,"e":26006},{"s":26064,"e":26320},{"s":26366,"e":26424},{"s":26471,"e":26621},{"s":26680,"e":27144},{"s":27214,"e":27353},{"s":27423,"e":27504},{"s":27562,"e":28061},{"s":28119,"e":28955},{"s":29396,"e":29512},{"s":29536,"e":29872},{"s":29930,"e":30081},{"s":30139,"e":30464},{"s":30511,"e":